00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:06.200
So jumping to a specific record, scanning the whole, every page does not cost me anything,

96
00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:07.460
even if I moved a record.

97
00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:09.720
And we will see in a moment how to implement this.

98
00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:10.620
Okay.

99
00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:16.340
So this is a pretty nice concept, very flexible and quite popular.

